Z||000008||MikeE||05-24-2000||08:25 PM||||Hi Phil,<BR>I found this forum from your link on the Quad4 list but you also gave me some info on the performance 3.4 DOHC list in the past.  I've wanted to email you some questions for a while but most have now been answered by reading your posts.  However, I see that you say you would not advise anyone to attempt this swap and would even try to dissuade them.  Why is that?  I realize you feel the swap is very difficult but solving a challenging swap is part of the fun of doing it, right?  I saw that others have broached the subject of you creating a Quad swap kit business but you may not want to take on the time and trouble such a venture involves.  However, would you consider compiling what you have learned about wiring, engine/trans mounts, dogbone, computer mounting, adapting the speedo/tach, etc., into some technical pages to help others who decide to go ahead and embark down this obviously treacherous path?  I'm sure everyone here would be willing to compensate you for any time and expense involved.  Any thoughts?||||reg||1
Z||000009||batboy||05-24-2000||09:42 PM||||Paul, keep the faith, bro! I had many dark days working on the Batmobile too. Yes, the wiring was butchered in it too when I took over the project. It will be worth it!||||reg||1
Z||000010||lowCG||05-24-2000||10:17 PM||||Ok what's up with the "3.4DOHC list"?<P>Any links would be much appreciated.<P>Was also wondering if Phil had any problems with the auto trans circuit(ECM)requiring a resistor somewhere to make it work in the manual trans car?||||reg||1
Z||000011||Phil||05-24-2000||10:37 PM||||I'm a little confused- I know nothing about quad 4 or 3.4 lists, maybe you have a different Phil in mind. As for the auto/stick resistor thing I did not do the conversion ACE did it. I do have a vss input error code that won't go away but it doesn't seem to louse anything up. Because I have the 5sp I can exceed the  max programmed rpm/mph ratios therefore the ECM thinks the tranny is slipping or something like that. All that aside it goes like a bat outta ----||||reg||1
Z||000012||MikeE||05-25-2000||08:35 AM||||Sorry Phil,<BR>That message was meant for Paul Herder who is on the Quad4 list.  I was surprised when I went back and saw I had written Phil rather than Paul.<P>To lowGG (I hope that's right) who wanted the link to the 3.4 DOHC list.  I had it bookmarked but that computer crashed a couple weeks ago.  I know I have it written somewhere but if I can't find it I'll do a search.  Once I find it I'll post it.<P>For anyone interested in the Quad4 list, it's at [URL=http://www.egroups.com/group/quadfourm]The misspelling of quadfourm is a mistake someone at egroups made but apparently they can't change it now so just type it in that way.  You can also sign up to recieve the list as emails but the list has grown so you will get a lot.||||reg||1
